      "snippet": "\nMadsen, C.J.\n\u00b61 At issue is whether RCW 4.24.550, a community notification statute relating to registered sex offenders, constitutes an \u201cother statute\u201d under the Public Records Act (PRA), chapter 42.56 RCW, that would exempt the blanket release of level I sex offender registration information from a PRA request. Appellant Donna Zink made several public records requests with the Washington State Patrol (WSP) and the Washington As",
